// durations this pins:
//   pr_created 09:00→10:00 (first pass) · 10:30→11:00 (rework 1) ·
//             11:30→11:45 (rework 2) = 1h + 30m + 15m
//   review     10:00→10:30 (first pass) · 11:00→11:30 (rework 1) ·
//             11:45→12:00 (rework 2) = 30m + 30m + 15m
//   approved_queue 12:00→now (live)
